Viktor 10.10.2026: «Для SEED сделай рандом -1, рандом fixed, fixed, next, prev»; «можно и в творце».

heresy-seedmode.js: beside the Creator's music and sound seeds (a row of its own under each: the dice sits inside the field) and the Artist's seed (beside ⟲): Random (−1), Random fixed, Fixed, Next, Previous, kept in this browser for each field. Before a run the field as its mode wants it; after it Next and Previous move it past the seeds the run used (the versions, the sound variations, the Artist's variations; BigInt for the 64-bit seeds). A number in a field is that seed as it always was (Random turns Fixed), an emptied field a new seed each run (Fixed turns Random).

Suite: 600/0 in the kitchen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
